{"path":"\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/' data-target='root' data-title=''>&#8962; <\/a>\r\n\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer' data-target='computer' data-title='Computer'>\r\n\t\t\tComputer\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/os' data-target='computer\/os' data-title='OS'>\r\n\t\t\tOS\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/os\/windows' data-target='computer\/os\/windows' data-title='Windows'>\r\n\t\t\tWindows\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/os\/windows\/command_shell' data-target='computer\/os\/windows\/command_shell' data-title='Command Shell'>\r\n\t\t\tCommand Shell\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n","async":"0","desc":"Completion keys, cmd /k, start /d, stream redirect, and comment forms in Command Prompt.","label":"Command Prompt","prevArticle":{"id":"computer\/os\/windows\/command_shell\/cd","label":"cd","url":"\/computer\/os\/windows\/command_shell\/cd"},"nextArticle":{"id":"computer\/os\/windows\/command_shell\/echo","label":"echo","url":"\/computer\/os\/windows\/command_shell\/echo"},"languageSwitcher":"<div id='language-switcher'>\n<\/div>\n","content":"<div id='message'>\n\t<h2>Complete on key<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\tSee [http:\/\/support.microsoft.com\/kb\/310530](http:\/\/support.microsoft.com\/kb\/310530).\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tOn:\n\t<\/p>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>cmd \/f<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<p>\n\t\tOff:\n\t<\/p>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>cmd \/f:off<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<h4>Permanent<\/h4>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\\Software\\Microsoft\\Command Processor<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<ul class=\"list-bullet content-list\">\n\t\t<li><div><code class='inline'>0x4<\/code> \u2014 Ctrl+D<\/div><\/li>\n\t\t<li><div><code class='inline'>0x4<\/code> \u2014 Ctrl+D<\/div><\/li>\n\t\t<li><div><code class='inline'>0x9<\/code> \u2014 Tab<\/div><\/li>\n\t<\/ul>\n\t<h2>Multiple commands<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\t<code class='inline'>\/k<\/code> runs a command and keeps the processor:\n\t<\/p>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>\/k &lt;command-1 [\"Arg-1\"]&gt;[ &amp; command -2]<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<h2>Start in a specific directory<\/h2>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>start \/d &lt;path&gt;<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<h2>Streams<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\tRedirect stdout to <code class='inline'>a.txt<\/code> and stderr to stdout:\n\t<\/p>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>&gt; a.txt 2&gt;&amp;1<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<h2>Comment<\/h2>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>Echo off &amp; REM<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<p>\n\t\t<code class='inline'>::<\/code> is an empty label. It spawns two lines and may break <code class='inline'>goto<\/code>.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>::<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<p>\n\t\tSame-line comment:\n\t<\/p>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>%= _ =%<\/code><\/pre>\n<\/div>\n\n<div id='updated-container'>\r\n\t<div id='updated'>\r\n\t\tUpdated:\r\n\t\t<span id='date'>\r\n\t\t\t2026 Aug 19\t\t<\/span>\r\n\t<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div class='center' id='content-body-separator'><\/div>\r\n<div id='sub-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div id='fb_components'>\r\n\t<div class=\"fb-comments\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/os\/windows\/command_shell\/command_prompt\"\n  data-numposts=\"50\">\n<\/div>\n\t<div class=\"fb-like\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/os\/windows\/command_shell\/command_prompt\"\n  data-layout=\"button\"\n  data-action=\"like\"\n  data-size=\"small\"\n  data-show-faces=\"false\"\n  data-share=\"true\">\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\r\n<div id='nav-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n\t<a id='nav-menu-prev'\r\n\t\t\tclass='XURL item_block_container' href='\/c